#10900
The Ant Hill~
This area (10901-10999) was created as a place for lower level 
characters to gain some exp on their own as well as learn some basic MUD 
commands.  Also included are a few pieces of eq to help them get started.

Smythe
~
109 0 0 0 0 0
S
#10901
Entrance to the Ant Hill~
    You are  standing on top of the  giant ant  hill.  It's quite a large 
hill...the ants that live inside must be REALLY big.  The hillside slopes
to the north, east, west and south.  There is a large hole going down
into the hill itself...I bet that's where the ants are.
~
